<title>POLAND: KPW CLEARS 1.2 MLN POLISA SHRS FOR TRADE.</title>
<headline>KPW CLEARS 1.2 MLN POLISA SHRS FOR TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has approved for public trade 1.2 million registered shares in Polish insurer Polisa SA, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>In July 1995 half the shares were issued to the National Fund for the Rehabilitation of the Handicapped, half to the state-owned Economic Development Agency.</p>
<p>Polisa has 10,792,458 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
